#: kaccess.cpp:733
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\", \"%2\" and \"%3\"?"
msgstr "Wil jy werklik \"%1\", \"%2\" en \"%3\" aktiveer?"

#: kaccess.cpp:737
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\", \"%2\" and \"%3\" and to deactivate \"%4\"?"
msgstr "Wil jy werklik \"%1\", \"%2\" en \"%3\" aktiveer  en \"%4\" deaktiveer ?"

#: kaccess.cpp:743
msgid "Do you really want to activate \"%1\", \"%2\", \"%3\" and \"%4\"?"
msgstr "Wil jy werklik \"%1\", \"%2\", \"%3\" en \"%4\" aktiveer?"

#: kaccess.cpp:750
msgid "An application has requested to change this setting."
msgstr "'n Program het versoek om hierdie verstelling te wysig."

#: kaccess.cpp:754
msgid "You held down the Shift key for 8 seconds or an application has requested to change this setting."
msgstr "Jy het die Verhoogsleutel vir 8 sekondes afgehou of 'n program het versoek om hierdie verstelling te wysig."

#: kaccess.cpp:756
msgid "You pressed the Shift key 5 consecutive times or an application has requested to change this setting."
msgstr "Jy het die Verhoogsleutel 5 agtereenvolgende kere gedruk of 'n program het versoek om hierdie verstelling te wysig."

#: kaccess.cpp:760
msgid "You pressed %1 or an application has requested to change this setting."
msgstr "Jy het %1 gedruk  of 'n program het versoek om hierdie verstelling te wysig."

#: kaccess.cpp:766
msgid "An application has requested to change these settings, or you used a combination of several keyboard gestures."
msgstr "'n Program het versoek om hierdie verstellings te wysig, of jy het 'n kombinasie van verskeie sleutelbord gebare gebruik."

#: kaccess.cpp:768
msgid "An application has requested to change these settings."
msgstr "'n Program het versoek om hierdie verstellings te wysig."

#: kaccess.cpp:773
msgid ""
"These AccessX settings are needed for some users with motion impairments and can be configured in the KDE Control Center. You can also turn them on and off with standardized keyboard gestures.\n"
"\n"
"If you do not need them, you can select \"Deactivate all AccessX features and gestures\"."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie AccessX verstellings word benodig vir sommige gebruikers met bewegingsinvloede en kan konfigureer word in die KDE Kontrole Sentrum. Jy kan ook dit aan en af skakel met gestandardiseerde sleutelbordgebare.\n"
"\n"
"As jy dit nie benodig nie, kan jy \"Deaktiveer alle AccessX beidraes en gebare\" kies."

#: kaccess.cpp:790
msgid "Slow keys has been enabled. From now on, you need to press each key for a certain length of time before it is accepted."
msgstr "Stadige sleutels is geaktiveer. Van nou af moet jy elke sleutel 'n sekere lengte tyd druk voordat dit aanvaar sal word."

#: kaccess.cpp:792
msgid "Slow keys has been disabled."
msgstr "Stadige sleutels is gedeaktiveer."

#: kaccess.cpp:795
msgid "Bounce keys has been enabled. From now on, each key will be blocked for a certain length of time after it is used."
msgstr "Bons sleutels is geaktiveer. Van nou af sal elke sleutel geblok word vir 'n sekere tydlengte, nadat dit gebruik was. "

#: kaccess.cpp:797
msgid "Bounce keys has been disabled."
msgstr "Bons sleutels is gedeaktiveer."

#: kaccess.cpp:800
msgid "Sticky keys has been enabled. From now on, modifier keys will stay latched after you have released them."
msgstr "Klewerige sleutels is geaktiveer. Van nou af sal veranderingsleutels gehak bly nadat jy dit gelos het."

#: kaccess.cpp:802
msgid "Sticky keys has been disabled."
msgstr "Klewerige sleutels is gedeaktiveer."

#: kaccess.cpp:805
msgid "Mouse keys has been enabled. From now on, you can use the number pad of your keyboard in order to control the mouse."
msgstr "Muis sleutels is geaktiveer. Van nou af kan jy die numeriese bord op jou sleutelbord gebruik ten einde die muis te beheer."

#: kaccess.cpp:807
msgid "Mouse keys has been disabled."
msgstr "Muis sleutels is gedeaktifeer."

